    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d473">

                <pb facs="0541" n="523" sameAs="frus:frus1946v11/pg523"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.5017/10–1746: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Chargé in
                        Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Daniels</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-10-17">October 17, 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1360. Depcirtel Oct 17 unnumbered.<anchor n="57" xml:id="d473-f1"/> Suspension
                    today OPA coffee ceilings terminated Aug 14 Memo of Understanding between Brazil
                    and US. Dept accordingly delivering note to Braz Emb withdrawing request for
                    October offering 500,000 bags coffee accordance that understanding. Please
                    inform FonOff this withdrawal.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
